==Description==
When Foundation fell, the final survivors at Capulca made this symbol represent hope. It is displayed on this plaque, the [[Helms#Helm of the Claw|Kusiman Helm]], and the [[Sail#Kusiman's Sail|Kusiman Sail]].<br><br>
This plaque in exclusively available to all tiers of the [[Founder's Pack]]. 
